    p1:["Where do you live?","What do you like most about your hometown?","Is there anything you dislike about living there?","Would you like to live in another city in the future?"],
    p1sample:{q:"What do you like most about your hometown?",a:"I really like the food in my hometown, Hai Phong. There are lots of small restaurants selling crab noodle soup, and they're very cheap. I also enjoy living near the sea, because I can go to the beach at weekends."},
    cue:{t:"Describe a city you would like to visit.",pts:["where it is","how you know about it","what you would do there"],end:"and explain why you would like to visit it."},
    p2sample:"I'd like to talk about Kyoto, a city in Japan. I first learned about it from a documentary I watched a few years ago, and since then I've read lots of travel blogs about it. Kyoto is famous for its ancient temples and beautiful gardens, so the first thing I would do is visit them, especially in autumn, when the leaves turn red. I'd also love to try the local food, like tofu dishes and green tea sweets. The main reason I want to go is that Kyoto seems very peaceful compared to my city, which is busy and noisy. I'd like to experience a slower lifestyle, even for just a few days.",
    p3:["What makes a city a good place to live?","Why do many young people move to big cities?"],
    phrases:["What I like most is…","I really enjoy…","I'm not very keen on…","One thing I don't like is…","…because…","For example,…"]
