    p1sample:{q:"Did you have a pet when you were young?",a:"Yes, I had a dog called Mít. I don't know the exact word for his type, but he was a kind of small, brown local dog with very short legs. I was really sad when he got old and died."},
    cue:{t:"Describe an animal you find interesting.",pts:["what the animal is","where you have seen it","what it looks like or does"],end:"and explain why you find it interesting."},
    p2sample:"I'd like to talk about dolphins, which I find fascinating. I saw them for the first time two years ago, when I took a boat trip near Nha Trang with my family. At first, I didn't believe my eyes, because I had only ever seen dolphins on TV. There were about six of them, and they were swimming and jumping right next to our boat. They have smooth grey skin and a long nose, a bit like a beak. What I find most interesting is how intelligent they are. Our guide told us that dolphins communicate with each other using different sounds, almost like a language. I felt really excited and also quite emotional, because they seemed to be playing with us. Since then, I've watched lots of documentaries about them.",
    p3:["Why is it important to protect wild animals?","Do you think zoos should exist?"],
